### Filling in the template

- Replace every `<…>` placeholder with content.
- Number findings sequentially (matching the txt report).
- Skip any severity group that has zero findings — do not render an empty `<div class="group-title">` for it.
- The Severity-row pill counts must equal the number of findings actually rendered for that severity. The "All" count must equal the total. Same for Exploitability-row pill counts (`Trivial`, `Moderate`, `Difficult`).
- Each `<article class="finding">` element must carry **both** `data-severity="…"` and `data-exploitability="…"` attributes (lowercase values: `critical|high|medium|low` and `trivial|moderate|difficult`).
- Each finding-head must show **both** the severity badge and the exploit badge (in that order, before the number).
